{"ffmpeg_verified": true, "total_duration": 147.0, "coverage": 1018.0, "gap": 0.58, "segments": [{"id": 1, "start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "Titan bel\u00fcgt uns. Aus der Ferne sieht er aus wie die Erde."}, {"id": 2, "start": 4, "end": 6, "text": "Fl\u00fcsse, Seen,"}, {"id": 3, "start": 6, "end": 9, "text": "K\u00fcstenlinien, Regen, Wolken, Jahreszeiten"}, {"id": 4, "start": 9, "end": 11, "text": "und eine dichte Atmosph\u00e4re."}, {"id": 5, "start": 11, "end": 13, "text": "Doch genau diese \u00c4hnlichkeit"}, {"id": 6, "start": 13, "end": 17, "text": "ist die Falle. Denn Titan ist nicht die Erde."}, {"id": 7, "start": 17, "end": 19, "text": "Titan ist eine"}, {"id": 8, "start": 19, "end": 22, "text": "eisige, giftige Parodie der Erde."}, {"id": 9, "start": 22, "end": 24, "text": "Eine Welt, die sich das"}, {"id": 10, "start": 24, "end": 28, "text": "Antlitz unseres Planeten geliehen und es mit Gift gef\u00fcllt hat."}, {"id": 11, "start": 28, "end": 32, "text": "Er umkreist den Saturn in einer Entfernung von"}, {"id": 12, "start": 32, "end": 35, "text": "etwa 1,2 Milliarden Kilometern zur Sonne."}, {"id": 13, "start": 35, "end": 39, "text": "Zehnmal weiter entfernt als die Erde."}, {"id": 14, "start": 39, "end": 41, "text": "In dieser Distanz schrumpft"}, {"id": 15, "start": 41, "end": 44, "text": "die Sonne zu einem schwachen Lichtpunkt, kaum"}, {"id": 16, "start": 44, "end": 47, "text": "heller als der Vollmond in einer klaren Nacht."}, {"id": 17, "start": 47, "end": 51, "text": "Die Oberfl\u00e4chentemperatur liegt bei etwa"}, {"id": 18, "start": 51, "end": 54, "text": "minus 179 Grad Celsius."}, {"id": 19, "start": 54, "end": 57, "text": "Das reicht aus, um Stahl spr\u00f6de wie Glas"}, {"id": 20, "start": 57, "end": 60, "text": "werden zu lassen und Methan, das wir nur"}, {"id": 21, "start": 60, "end": 63, "text": "als Gas kennen, in eine Fl\u00fcssigkeit zu verwandeln."}, {"id": 22, "start": 63, "end": 66, "text": "Und genau dieses fl\u00fcssige Methan"}, {"id": 23, "start": 66, "end": 70, "text": "f\u00fcllt die Seen und Fl\u00fcsse des Titan."}, {"id": 24, "start": 70, "end": 73, "text": "Kein Wasser, sondern Methan."}, {"id": 25, "start": 73, "end": 75, "text": "Als die Raumsonde Cassini"}, {"id": 26, "start": 75, "end": 77, "text": "im Jahr 2004 den"}, {"id": 27, "start": 77, "end": 81, "text": "Saturn erreichte, hatte sie den Lander Huygens an Bord."}, {"id": 28, "start": 81, "end": 83, "text": "ein Projekt der"}, {"id": 29, "start": 83, "end": 87, "text": "Europ\u00e4ischen Weltraumorganisation. Am 14. Januar 2005"}, {"id": 30, "start": 87, "end": 90, "text": "trennte sich Huygens ab und"}, {"id": 31, "start": 90, "end": 93, "text": "begann den Abstieg zur Oberfl\u00e4che des"}, {"id": 32, "start": 93, "end": 97, "text": "Titan. Der Sinkflug durch die Atmosph\u00e4re dauerte etwa"}, {"id": 33, "start": 97, "end": 101, "text": "zwei Stunden. Und alles, was die Sonde auf"}, {"id": 34, "start": 101, "end": 104, "text": "ihrem Wege nach unten registrierte, ver\u00e4nderte unsere"}, {"id": 35, "start": 104, "end": 108, "text": "Vorstellung davon, wie Planeten und Monde beschaffen sein"}, {"id": 36, "start": 108, "end": 110, "text": "k\u00f6nnen und was es bedeutet,"}, {"id": 37, "start": 110, "end": 113, "text": "eine vertraute Welt vor sich zu haben."}, {"id": 38, "start": 113, "end": 116, "text": "Das Erste, worauf sie"}, {"id": 39, "start": 116, "end": 118, "text": "stie\u00df, war die Atmosph\u00e4re."}, {"id": 40, "start": 118, "end": 120, "text": "Sie ist etwa anderthalb"}, {"id": 41, "start": 120, "end": 123, "text": "Mal so dicht wie die der Erde."}, {"id": 42, "start": 123, "end": 125, "text": "Damit ist Titan der"}, {"id": 43, "start": 125, "end": 128, "text": "einzige Mond mit einer wirklich massiven Gash\u00fclle."}, {"id": 44, "start": 128, "end": 132, "text": "Die Basis bildet Stickstoff, etwa 95 Prozent, genau"}, {"id": 45, "start": 132, "end": 134, "text": "wie auf der Erde."}, {"id": 46, "start": 134, "end": 136, "text": "Doch die \u00c4hnlichkeit tr\u00fcgt."}, {"id": 47, "start": 136, "end": 139, "text": "Die restlichen 5% bestehen aus"}, {"id": 48, "start": 139, "end": 141, "text": "einer Mischung aus"}, {"id": 49, "start": 141, "end": 145, "text": "Methan, Wasserstoff und organischen Verbindungen, die mit"}, {"id": 50, "start": 145, "end": 147, "text": "dem ultravioletten Licht reagieren"}], "words": [{"word": " Titan", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.3}, {"word": " bel\u00fcgt", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.86}, {"word": " uns.", "start": 0.86, "end": 1.18}, {"word": " Aus", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.78}, {"word": " der", "start": 1.78, "end": 1.86}, {"word": " Ferne", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.16}, {"word": " sieht", "start": 2.16, "end": 2.36}, {"word": " er", "start": 2.36, "end": 2.42}, {"word": " aus", "start": 2.42, "end": 2.72}, {"word": " wie", "start": 2.72, "end": 2.86}, {"word": " die", "start": 2.86, "end": 3.0}, {"word": " Erde.", "start": 3.0, "end": 3.32}, {"word": " Fl\u00fcsse,", "start": 3.64, "end": 4.3}, {"word": " Seen,", "start": 4.66, "end": 5.02}, {"word": " K\u00fcstenlinien,", "start": 5.36, "end": 6.1}, {"word": " Regen,", "start": 6.5, "end": 6.86}, {"word": " Wolken,", "start": 7.22, "end": 7.64}, {"word": " Jahreszeiten", "start": 8.06, "end": 8.84}, {"word": " und", "start": 8.84, "end": 9.34}, {"word": " eine", "start": 9.34, "end": 9.66}, {"word": " dichte", "start": 9.66, "end": 9.96}, {"word": " Atmosph\u00e4re.", "start": 9.96, "end": 10.6}, {"word": " Doch", "start": 10.96, "end": 11.24}, {"word": " genau", "start": 11.24, "end": 11.46}, {"word": " diese", "start": 11.46, "end": 11.88}, {"word": " \u00c4hnlichkeit", "start": 11.88, "end": 12.56}, {"word": " ist", "start": 12.56, "end": 13.12}, {"word": " die", "start": 13.12, "end": 13.38}, {"word": " Falle.", "start": 13.38, "end": 13.8}, {"word": " Denn", "start": 14.08, "end": 14.34}, {"word": " Titan", "start": 14.34, "end": 14.66}, {"word": " ist", "start": 14.66, "end": 15.46}, {"wor